the n0 is compressor
the n1 is phasor samplerate=half
the n2 is vcmix samplerate=quarter
the n3 is attenuverter amount=1.835
the n4 is rain samplerate=quarter
n4 => n0
n3 => n0
n0.gain -> n0.side
n4 -50> n1.reset
n1 -> n2.in2
n4.pulse -> n2.in4
n0 -> n2.level3
n4 => n3
n4.pulse -35> n3.amount
n0 -> n3.amount
n4 ~> n3.offset
n1 -> left
n2 -> right
n0 -> right
n3 -> right
